<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Nova Hut steel to issue CZK 1bln, 7-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Czech Nova Hut steel to issue CZK 1bln, 7-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech steel maker Nova Hut a.s. on Wednesday said it would issue a one billion crown tranche of seven-year bonds on November 18.</p>
<p>The book-form bonds will carry an annual coupon of 12.7 percent, the firm said in a published statement.</p>
<p>It added that Komercni Banka will lead manage the issue.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
